# Alembic migrations for FlowOrder

This directory contains Alembic migration scripts for the FlowOrder database schema.

## Usage

```bash
# Run all pending migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Downgrade one version
alembic downgrade -1

# Downgrade to base (all tables)
alembic downgrade base

# Create a new migration
alembic revision -m "description of change"

# Auto-generate a migration from schema changes
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

# View current migration version
alembic current

# View migration history
alembic history
```

## Configuration

Set `DATABASE_URL` environment variable before running Alembic:

```bash
# PostgreSQL (production)
set DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:port/floworder

# PostgreSQL (test)
set DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:port/test_floworder
```

## Current Migrations

- `001_initial_schema.py` - Initial schema with all 24 tables
